    "text": "Conjecture Let $G$ be a $2$-connected cubic graph and let $S$ be a $2$-regular subgraph such that $G-E(S)$ is connected. Then $G$ has a cycle double cover which contains $S$ (i.e all cycles of $S$ ).",
